<title>USA: Boston Edison Co Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Boston Edison Co Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p> THREE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30:  1996	  1995  % CHANGE</p>
<p> Operating revenue		  $497,968   $498,554    (0.1)%</p>
<p> Net income			     80,011     77,452     3.3 %</p>
<p> Preferred dividends provided	3,817	3,890    (1.9)%</p>
<p> Earnings per share		     1.58	 1.57     0.6 %</p>
<p> Weighted average no. of shares   48,327     46,861     3.1 %</p>
<p>NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30:	1996	1995  % CHANGE</p>
<p> Operating revenue		$1,275,573 $1,259,061     1.3 %</p>
<p> Net income			    133,141    123,791     7.6 %</p>
<p> Preferred dividends provided     11,548     11,681    (1.1)%</p>
<p> Earnings per share		     2.52	 2.43     3.7 %</p>
<p> Weighted average no. of shares   48,198     46,129     4.5 %</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 and nine-month 95 net and EPS exclude $5.0 million after tax restructuring charge, or $0.11 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
